# The run image's build context is the repository root: only the Bruno CLI's
# lockfile, the collection and the run pod's entrypoint are needed. Local run
# reports stay out.
*
!Oscar_Server/bruno-cli/package.json
!Oscar_Server/bruno-cli/package-lock.json
!Oscar_Server/src/run-pod
!Bruno_Collection
Bruno_Collection/Validation_Reports
